  "winnt.h": "Windows SDK on the windows-2025 runner, read by probes/guest_state (offsetof/sizeof)",
  "winternl.h": "same; Microsoft Learn TEB page (MicrosoftDocs/sdk-api docs 7659b39b6294): 'This structure may be altered in future versions of Windows'",
  "observation": "probes/guest_state on the windows-2025 runner: the field read through gs: or from a handler's CONTEXT equals the value an API reports",
